{{also|Іван}}
==Bulgarian==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|bg|cu|Їѡанъ}}, {{m|cu|Їѡаннъ}}, transliteration of {{bor|bg|grc|Ἰωάννης}}. Ultimately from {{der|bg|he|יוֹחָנָן|tr=Jōħānān|t=God is gracious}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{bg-IPA|Ива́н}}

===Proper noun===
{{bg-proper noun|Ива́н|m|f=Ива́на|dim=Ва́ньо|dim2=Ива́нчо|dim3=Ива́нко}}

# {{given name|bg|male|xlit=Ivan|eq=John}}

====Alternative forms====
* {{alter|bg|Йоа́н}}, {{alter|bg|Йова́н}}

====Declension====
{{bg-ndecl|Ива́н<(v)/n:sg>}}

====Derived terms====
* [[surname|Surname]]s:
** {{l|bg|Ивано́в|g=m}}, {{l|bg|Ивано́ва|g=f}}

===References===
* [https://histdict.uni-sofia.bg/dictionary/show/d_03294 Иоанъ] in ''Исторически речник на Българския език'', Sofia University "St. Clement Ohridsky"

